  "description": "Platform health — pod state, restart counts, node memory pressure. The 7.0.a SPIFFE-CSI startupProbe soak verifies on the SPIFFE-CSI-restart panel: zero post-Docker-Desktop-restart manual `kubectl delete pod` operations across 7 consecutive days.",
  "editable": false,
